    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6163" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Călaurĭa</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Călaurēa</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 7,
		384</span></i>), ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καλαύρεια</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">᾽ί᾽α</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an island on the
				eastern coast of Argolis</i>, now <i>Poro</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Mel.
				2, 7, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12, 19, §
				56</span></i>.—<i>Consecrated to Latona</i>,
			hence, Calaurea Latois, Ov. l. l.</div>
